# Opportunity Workspace Context (FROZEN)

## SSOT

Enterprise **Opportunity Registry** — not LoanFiles — owns the Opportunity lifecycle.

## Shared context (minimum)

`opportunityId` · `opportunityReference` · `contactId` · `customer` · `product` · `stage` · `owner`

Optional: `fileId` only when a Deal/LoanFile is later attached. Never set `fileId = opportunityId`.

## Stages

Lead Creation → Documents → Credit Bench → LIFE

All consume the same active Opportunity context. Modules must not independently pick which Opportunity to load.

## Selection screen

Only when left-nav opens a module (`entry=dashboard`) or no active `opportunityId` exists.

## SSOT paths

- Session: `active-context.ts`
- Registry remember: `opportunity-context.ts`
- Hook: `useOpportunityWorkspaceContext`
- Opportunity-only stage shell: `OpportunityBoundStage`
- Picker: `OpportunityContextPicker` (Registry API)
